      "migration_notes": ["fidelity exact (2026-10-09): every live block carried over in full and in order; nothing cut. Cards → Bild och text or article items; quotes → blockquotes; all news items kept. Live /media/ image URLs where given, else placeholders. Sidebar nav → hub/sibling model.", "nav.siblings: the rows of hub group 'Lediga jobb'", "jobs: the live page's OneCruiter iframe is replaced by a native list of the 8 positions open on 2026-10-09, read from vinge.onecruiter.com (raw/karriar/lediga-jobb/_jobs.json, verbatim). Office from the listing; intro = first paragraph after the firm boilerplate; deadline only where the ad states one (3 of 8). The full ad and the application stay in OneCruiter (links).", "application: no general form — the live Lediga jobb page lists positions by title and each opens its own ad with its own form. Form fields verbatim from a job page on vinge.onecruiter.com (9 fields, 'Skicka ansökan'); the position id is passed hidden. The recruiter's separate open-application page is not linked from vinge.se and is left out.", "positions[].body: the full ad text, verbatim from the eight job pages (raw/karriar/lediga-jobb/_jobs.json)."]
